<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the</p>
<p>Scottish premier division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>17 - Jorge Cadete (Celtic)</p>
<p>14 - Pierre Van Hooydonk (Celtic)</p>
<p>13 - Paul Gascoigne (Rangers)</p>
<p>11 - Billy Dodds (Aberdeen), John Robertson (Hearts)</p>
<p>10 - Gerry Britton (Dunfermline), Darren Jackson</p>
<p>(Hibernian)</p>
<p>9 - Ally McCoist (Rangers), Dean Windass (Aberdeen),</p>
<p>Brian Laudrup (Rangers), Erik Bo Andersen (Rangers)</p>
